        {
            "brief": "sets shader constants in a compute program",
            "description": "Sets shader constants in a compute program, if the constants exist.",
            "error": "",
            "examples": "Set a shader constant in a compute program\n<div class=\"codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kr\">function</span> <span class=\"nf\">update</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">self</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"c1\">-- update the &#39;tint&#39; constant</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">compute</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">set_constants</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;/my_compute.computec&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">tint</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"n\">value</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">vmath</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">vector4</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">})</span>\n    <span class=\"c1\">-- change the type of the &#39;view_proj&#39; constant to CONSTANT_TYPE_USER_MATRIX4 so the renderer can set our custom data</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">compute</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">set_constants</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;/my_compute.computec&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">view_proj</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"n\">value</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">self</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">my_view_proj</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nb\">type</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">material</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">CONSTANT_TYPE_USER_MATRIX4</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">})</span>\n<span class=\"kr\">end</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
