        {
            "brief": "sets texture samplers in a compute program",
            "description": "Sets texture samplers in a compute program, if the samplers exist. Use this function to change the settings of texture samplers.\nTo set actual textures that should be bound to the samplers, use the <code>compute.set_textures</code> function instead.",
            "error": "",
            "examples": "Configures a sampler in a compute program\n<div class=\"codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kr\">function</span> <span class=\"nf\">init</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">self</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">compute</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">set_samplers</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;/my_compute.computec&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">texture_sampler</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"n\">u_wrap</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">graphics</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">TEXTURE_WRAP_REPEAT</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">v_wrap</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">graphics</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">TEXTURE_WRAP_MIRRORED_REPEAT</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">})</span>\n<span class=\"kr\">end</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
